# bat -- rounders bat, nobody remembers whose league. Grip at the origin, barrel along +Z (the
# swing/aim direction a hand attachment or viewmodel expects); the knob pokes 1.5cm behind the
# origin, same as a real bat's butt end sits just below where the hand actually grips.
# Piece size is (diameter, length, diameter); pitch 90 turns the shape primitives' default
# vertical (+Y) axis to point along +Z.
